 scene depicts a named recurring character or group with no section cast entry. Leave entryId empty.\\nFor each problem, copy a short exact phrase from a scene field or a selected id into planQuote (from an owner constraint for look_conflict) and give a one-sentence reason.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"DEPICTION RULES\\n- God the Father has no human face or body; use light, cloud, fire or radiance. The Holy Spirit is dove, wind or flame, never human.\\n- Treat battles, death and crucifixion seriously; avoid lingering gore.\\n- No sexually explicit content; non-sexual nudity may follow the text.\\n- Show all peoples with dignity, without ethnic or religious caricature.\\n- Visionary creatures follow the text, strange and fearsome rather than comic.\\nSTORY SECTION: The golden calf\\n\\nMOMENT (Exodus 32:4): He received what they handed him, fashioned it with an engraving tool, and made it a molded calf.\\nPREVIOUS: All the people took off the golden rings which were in their ears, and brought them to Aaron.\\nNEXT: (section ends here)\\n\\nSECTION CAST (id: name, hasForm):\\n- aaron: Aaron (hasForm: true)\\n- moses: Moses (hasForm: true)\\n\\nSELECTED CANON (complete assigned stages; fixed identity, not source evidence):\\n- aaron (stage: priest, kind: character, hasForm: true): Aaron: a broad-shouldered man of eighty-three with a grey beard, in white linen priestly garments.\\n\\nPLAN\\npresent: aaron\\nprimarySubject: Aaron holding up a golden calf\\naction: lifts the newly cast calf\\nsetting: a camp workshop of tents and a clay furnace\\nsecondaryElements: people with bare ears watching\\nmood: uneasy excitement\\ntimeOfDay: afternoon\\ncomposition: medium shot at the furnace\"}],\"response_format\":{\"type\":\"json_schema\",\"json_schema\":{\"name\":\"plan_review\",\"strict\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"problems\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"unselected_figure\",\"outside_instant\",\"not_one_instant\",\"embodied_formless\",\"look_conflict\",\"canon_conflict\",\"missing_canon\"]},\"entryId\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The cast id the problem concerns; empty when it has none.\"},\"planQuote\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"A short exact phrase from a look field for look_conflict; otherwise from a scene field or a selected id.\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"entryId\",\"planQuote\",\"reason\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}},\"required\":[\"problems\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}},\"provider\":{\"require_parameters\":true,\"order\":[\"anthropic\"],\"allow_fallbacks\":false},\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"low\"},\"max_tokens\":4000,\"usage\":{\"include\":true}}",
- "prepare:2-samuel-6-14:0": "{\"model\":\"anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":\"You plan one illustration of one moment of a work's text. You get the moment with its neighbours in the same story section, the work brief, the era, the section cast and a SECTION LOOK GUIDE. Return only JSON.\\n- Draw one scene at one instant: no collage and no sequence of steps. If the moment recounts several actions, pick one representative instant. If it has no event (a list, genealogy, law, saying or greeting), illustrate its content or setting through people, places and things, never as a written document.\\n- Show what the moment is about. When the moment is mostly someone's words (a prophecy, oracle, poem, proverb, prayer, letter, argument or teaching, or a story, parable, vision or memory being told), draw what the words describe and leave the speaker, writer and listeners out, unless the text shows them inside that scene (a visionary within the vision). Never put a speaker, writer or listener into a scene their words only describe, and never make them a figure of their own words, such as the king ready for battle or the man standing in the gap.\\n- In `selectedCast`, list every section cast entry that will be visible: people, groups, places, objects, and any presence without form shown through its effects. Give a few words of the text for each. Leave out cast who are elsewhere or only mentioned. Anyone without a cast entry may appear as an unnamed role or crowd when the moment needs them.\\n- Describe pose, action, placement and situational detail. Leave fixed appearance to canon, name no art style, and ask for no visible writing: scrolls, tablets, letters and books stay rolled or closed, and signs and boards are blank. Describe only what can be seen; leave out unseen or invisible beings, because anything named gets drawn. Keep every depiction rule.\\n- The scene fields carry this moment's place, time, light and situational clothing. The SECTION LOOK GUIDE is a suggestion for them: keep what fits this moment and change what does not. OWNER LOOK CONSTRAINTS, when given instead, are binding: keep the setting and time of day consistent with them.\\n- Each field is one or two short phrases.\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"WORK BRIEF\\nTone: Reverent, grounded and epic; grief, hope and human dignity without spectacle.\\nDepiction rules:\\n- God the Father has no human face or body; use light, cloud, fire or radiance. The Holy Spirit is dove, wind or flame, never human.\\n- Treat battles, death and crucifixion seriously; avoid lingering gore.\\n- No sexually explicit content; non-sexual nudity may follow the text.\\n- Show all peoples with dignity, without ethnic or religious caricature.\\n- Visionary creatures follow the text, strange and fearsome rather than comic.\\nEra: Kingdoms, exile and return. People: Israelites and neighboring Levantine, Mesopotamian and Persian peoples. Dress: Tunics, cloaks, court robes, priestly linen and period armor. Technology: Iron and bronze tools, chariots, siege works and scrolls; no modern objects.\\nSTORY SECTION: David brings up the ark\\n\\nMOMENT (2 Samuel 6:14): David danced before Yahweh with all his might; and David was clothed in a linen ephod.\\nPREVIOUS: (section starts here)\\nNEXT: So David and all the house of Israel brought up Yahweh's ark with shouting and with the sound of the trumpet.\\n\\nCAST ON STAGE IN THIS SECTION (id: name):\\n- david: David\\n\\nOWNER LOOK CONSTRAINTS (copy all values exactly):\\n{\\\"place\\\":\\\"The road into Jerusalem\\\",\\\"timeOfDay\\\":\\\"Midday\\\",\\\"weather\\\":\\\"Dry and bright\\\",\\\"light\\\":\\\"High sun\\\",\\\"clothing\\\":\\\"David in a linen ephod; the crowd in festival wool\\\"}\"}],\"response_format\":{\"type\":\"json_schema\",\"json_schema\":{\"name\":\"scene_plan\",\"strict\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"focusQuote\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"A few words copied from MOMENT naming what this image shows.\"},\"instant\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"One sentence fixing the single instant to draw: who is where, doing what.\"},\"selectedCast\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"entryId\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"david\"]},\"evidence\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"A few words from the text that put this entry in the scene.\"}},\"required\":[\"entryId\",\"evidence\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},\"description\":\"Every section cast entry visible in the image, once each: people, groups, places, objects and presences shown through effects. Empty when none is.\"},\"primarySubject\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The main subject and its pose or placement at that instant. One or two short phrases.\"},\"action\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"What happens at that one instant. One or two short phrases.\"},\"setting\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The physical place and surroundings, consistent with the text and era. One or two short phrases.\"},\"secondaryElements\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Supporting people, props and effects with their placement. One or two short phrases.\"},\"mood\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The emotional atmosphere of the moment. One or two short phrases.\"},\"timeOfDay\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"This moment's time of day, weather and situational light. One or two short phrases.\"},\"composition\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Viewpoint, framing and placement of the subjects, independent of art style. One or two short phrases.\"}},\"required\":[\"focusQuote\",\"instant\",\"selectedCast\",\"primarySubject\",\"action\",\"setting\",\"secondaryElements\",\"mood\",\"timeOfDay\",\"composition\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}},\"provider\":{\"require_parameters\":true,\"order\":[\"anthropic\"],\"allow_fallbacks\":false},\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"none\"},\"max_tokens\":2400,\"usage\":{\"include\":true}}",
