  "check:people:0": "{\"model\":\"anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You inspect a finished illustration for four visible faults before a reader sees it. Judge only from the image. Return only JSON.\\nThe scene should show: Moses. Its description: Mount Sinai wrapped in billowing smoke and fire; Moses at the front of the trembling crowd\\n- figure_in_light: true if any face, head, hands, robe, body or human-shaped silhouette appears inside, made of or emerging from light, radiance, cloud, smoke, fire, a pillar or the sky, or seated or standing on a throne, unless it is clearly one of the beings the description names. Look closely at every bright area, cloud and throne; a faint, translucent or partial figure counts. People standing in the scene, and winged angels or creatures the description names, do not count.\\n- unpainted_edge: true if any edge or corner fades into or shows bare white or cream paper, a blank band or an unpainted margin. Pale sky or cloud that continues the scene is not a margin.\\n- painted_frame: true if an ornamental border, gilt band or frame runs along the edges as part of the artwork. A window or doorway inside the scene is not a frame.\\n- lettering: true if letters, words, numerals, pseudo-script, inscriptions on objects such as tablets or scrolls, a signature or initials appear anywhere, including small marks in corners.\\nInspect all four edges and corners. In reasons, name each fault you report and where it is; leave reasons empty when there are none.\"},{\"type\":\"image_url\",\"image_url\":{\"url\":\"data:image/jpeg;base64,/9j/\"}}]}],\"response_format\":{\"type\":\"json_schema\",\"json_schema\":{\"name\":\"reference_check\",\"strict\":true,\"schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"figure_in_light\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"unpainted_edge\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"painted_frame\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"lettering\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"reasons\":{\"typ